#X obj 638 8 array.resample;
#X obj 230 78 cnv 1 535 136 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -237178 -1 0;
#X text 240 83 The object resamples the source array and writes the
result into the destination array. The resampling factor is set with
the @ratio property (source size divided by destination size) and the
quality of the resampling is controlled with the @quality property.
When a bang is received \, the resampling is started \, and the number
of samples in the resulting array is sent to the outlet.;
